<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Multiple P Classes per SYNC SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
.KRCC { Name: Korean; lang: ko-KR; SAMIType: CC; }
.JPCC { Name: Japanese; lang: ja-JP; SAMIType: CC; }
#Source { color: red; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>Narrator</P>
<P Class=ENUSCC>In a world far away...</P>
<P Class=KRCC ID=Source>나레이터</P>
<P Class=KRCC>아주 먼 세계에서...</P>
<P Class=JPCC ID=Source>語り手</P>
<P Class=JPCC>遠く離れた世界で...</P>

<SYNC Start=4000>
<P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>Hero</P>
<P Class=ENUSCC>I must save the kingdom!</P>
<P Class=KRCC ID=Source>영웅</P>
<P Class=KRCC>내가 왕국을 구해야 해!</P>
<P Class=JPCC ID=Source>英雄</P>
<P Class=JPCC>王国を救わなければ！</P>

<SYNC Start=8000>
<P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>Villain</P>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Not if I can help it.</P>
<P Class=KRCC ID=Source>악당</P>
<P Class=KRCC>내가 막을 테니까.</P>
<P Class=JPCC ID=Source>悪役</P>
<P Class=JPCC>私が阻止してみせる。</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
